Third-party code
----------------

The key-count conversion in `src/transform/rizu/` and `src/transform/automap.ts`
is a TypeScript port of the automapper from rizu vsrg:

    rizu vsrg
    https://github.com/semyon422/rizu
    Copyright (C) rizu contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

Ported files (original rizu paths):

    chart/transform/NotePreprocessor.lua  -> src/transform/rizu/preprocess.ts
    chart/transform/BlockFinder.lua       -> src/transform/rizu/blocks.ts
    chart/transform/NoteBlock.lua         -> src/transform/rizu/blocks.ts
    chart/transform/LinePreReductor.lua   -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/NoteCountReductor.lua -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/LineBalancer.lua      -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/NoteApplyer.lua       -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/LongNoteReductor.lua  -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/Reductor.lua          -> src/transform/rizu/reduce.ts
    chart/transform/NextUpscaler.lua      -> src/transform/rizu/expand.ts
    chart/transform/SolutionSeeker.lua    -> src/transform/rizu/expand.ts
    chart/scoring/enps.lua                -> src/transform/rizu/enps.ts
    sphere/models/ModifierModel/Automap.lua -> src/transform/automap.ts

Only the key-count conversion was taken. rizu's scratch-lane mapping,
difficulty generation and chart formats are not part of this port.
